ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XDVK7EBKDR2M1E10XQ3YH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XDWKYNMR2AHV8M0YMT583","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XDXMTF029VQF8NKKJ36A7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XDYN0E9JC9BT3S3NCZ7RA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XDZPNPFRR4A7YJA0EFVP0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE0QDKM4RATRX1KE4XDYV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE1Q29EG4EBTP2QS0V8BC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE2RF6DVEMZW6V2KVDWMY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE3V71Y9EPT8VQ617K514","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE4VK5JZB4CHC54V7ZYRA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE5WME4W18SSASKYDBD2K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XE6ZA81PAC1HJ6B07QST0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも沢山ありがとうございます😊！\nレーンがお花の香りで溢れていて、癒されながら握手楽しめました🙈💗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいい香り～☺️\n浴衣もお花の柄やったからお花祭りや～👘💗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあね( ᐛ )٩و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#54"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-hina-25211":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46 2期生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪府出身 15歳 小坂菜緒です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/201805/mobgZYBAo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家で豆腐を食べるようになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと飽きて、食べなくなってて、また食べるようになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆腐に合うおかずを現在調べ中です🐰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家にあるのは、かつお節・とろろ昆布・醤油・納豆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定番のものしかないうちの調味料とおかずたち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、これいける！って食べ物があれば教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷奴で食べるのは好きじゃないです…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"✽+†+✽――✽+†+✽――✽+†+✽――"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月20日~5月6日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46 舞台「あゆみ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってから1週間経ちましたが、無事にすべての公演を終了しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろうなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めは怖くて怖くて、台詞も覚えられないし絶対無理だーって言ってたけど、スタッフさんやムックさんがたくさんアドバイスをして下さったり、楽しい面白い演出を考えてくださって、演技をやる楽しさをまた改めて知ることが出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がやった役の中で1番深い役は尾崎さんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尾崎さんは昔の私に似てるところがあるんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の頃の自分とリンクする瞬間がたくさんあって、だから昔の自分を思い出してるような、不思議な感じがしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"複雑な気持ちになったり、嬉しかったり、悲しくなったり…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても演じやすかった役でもあります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので尾崎さんをやることが出来て本当に良かったなぁと終わってからすごく思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のあみちゃんと尾崎さんのシーンは、回想シーンに思えるんですけど、尾崎さんは死んでるって事なんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、小学生の頃の元気良さが残ってる部分が(私が皆さんに伝えることが出来ていれば)ありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんがどれだけ歳をとっても、尾崎さんは永遠の小学生なんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"亡くなった尾崎さんと出会えたあみちゃんの心情があの「謝る」って事なんですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのシーンほんとに好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰か共感してください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ねりけしのシーンめっちゃ好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"